&lt;h2 id="-instance-creation"&gt;☁️ Instance Creation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="c3-configuration"&gt;C3 Configuration
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud Console&lt;/strong&gt; and create a VM under your project:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select &lt;strong&gt;C3&lt;/strong&gt; in Machine configuration, specify &lt;strong&gt;c3-standard-176&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set CPU platform and enable &lt;strong&gt;all-core turbo&lt;/strong&gt; for stable performance 3. Configure OS and storage as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain default configurations for other settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://huggingface.co/datasets/Intel/blog/resolve/main/gpt-oss-on-intel-xeon/spr.png"
loading="lazy"
alt="C3 Configuration"
&gt;
&lt;em&gt;C3 instance configuration with 176 vCPUs&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="c4-configuration"&gt;C4 Configuration
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Follow similar steps for &lt;strong&gt;C4&lt;/strong&gt; instance creation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select &lt;strong&gt;C4&lt;/strong&gt; in Machine configuration, specify &lt;strong&gt;c4-standard-144&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure CPU platform and enable all-core turbo 3. Apply same OS and storage configuration as C3&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the 144 vCPU instance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://huggingface.co/datasets/Intel/blog/resolve/main/gpt-oss-on-intel-xeon/gnr.png"
loading="lazy"
alt="C4 Configuration"
&gt;
&lt;em&gt;C4 instance configuration with 144 vCPUs&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-environment-setu"&gt;🛠️ Environment Setu
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;SSH into the instance and install Docker. Follow these reproducible setup steps:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clone repository&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;git clone https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.git&lt;/code&gt;2. &lt;strong&gt;Navigate and checkout&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;cd transformers/ &amp;amp;&amp;amp; git checkout 26b65fb5168f324277b85c558ef8209bfceae1fe&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Docker image&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;cd docker/transformers-intel-cpu/ &amp;amp;&amp;amp; sudo docker build . -t &amp;lt;your_docker_image_tag&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run container&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;sudo docker run -it --rm --privileged -v /home/&amp;lt;your_home_folder&amp;gt;:/workspace &amp;lt;your_docker_image_tag&amp;gt; /bin/bash&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inside the container:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Install transformers&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;pip install git+https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.git@26b65fb5168f324277b85c558ef8209bfceae1fe&lt;/code&gt;2. &lt;strong&gt;Install PyTorch&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;pip install torch==2.8.0 torchvision torchaudio --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-benchmark-procedure"&gt;📊 Benchmark Procedure
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For each batch size:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build fixed-length 1024-token left-padded batch 2. Execute single warm-up round&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set &lt;code&gt;max_new_tokens=1024&lt;/code&gt; and measure total latency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calculate: &lt;code&gt;throughput = (OUTPUT_TOKENS * batch_size) / total_latency&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Execute with: &lt;code&gt;numactl -l python benchmark.py&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
